                <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fillColor=#f8fafc;" value="IDENTITY AND CONSISTENCY&#xa;&#xa;• PK = primary key; FK = foreign key; ? = nullable.&#xa;• Solid relationships: one parent to zero or many children.&#xa;• Import UQ*: (owner_id, card_id, file_sha256).&#xa;• Entry UQ*: (import_id, sequence), never merchant / amount.&#xa;• Enforce same-owner composite foreign keys throughout.&#xa;• active_import_id must belong to the same statement.&#xa;• Candidate files never silently replace the selected source." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="260" width="680" x="40" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="retention" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fillColor=#f8fafc;" value="PDF RETENTION — CONFIGURABLE POLICY&#xa;&#xa;• PDF bytes live on Import; ordinary queries exclude them.&#xa;• pdf_months = 24 is a configurable default, not a fixed limit.&#xa;• pdf_cleanup_enabled = false prevents policy cleanup.&#xa;• On cleanup: clear pdf_bytes and set pdf_deleted_at.&#xa;• Keep imports, fingerprints, and extracted entries.&#xa;• Missing statement dates require review, not invented expiry.&#xa;• Applying changes to existing PDFs: awaiting confirmation." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="260" width="680" x="750" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="evidence" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=18;fontSize=15;fontColor=#1e293b;strokeColor=#cbd5e1;fillColor=#f8fafc;" value="EVIDENCE AND IMPLEMENTATION BOUNDARY&#xa;&#xa;• amount uses exact Decimal-compatible NUMERIC, not float.&#xa;• Preserve nulls, raw source evidence, and parser issues.&#xa;• review_status: pending / reviewed / rejected.&#xa;• Totals use entries from the statement&#39;s active import.&#xa;• BINARY maps to PostgreSQL bytea through the SQL layer.&#xa;• Owner records alone do not provide authentication.&#xa;• Default-deny RLS is not per-user authentication.&#xa;• Versioned migration awaits PR review before deployment." vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="260" width="680" x="1460" y="815" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
